  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p>​The AEC is a science-based tool that groups and classifies Ontario’s rivers and streams based on their:&nbsp;</p><div><ul><li><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255);'>physical attributes, such as water temperature&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style='background-color:rgb(255,255,255);'>watershed characteristics, such as upstream drainage area&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p>The Ministry of Natural Resources (MNR) is responsible for sustainably managing and deriving economic benefit from the fisheries and water resources in the ~500,000 km of Ontario’s rivers and streams.&nbsp;</p></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>The AEC reduces the complexity of these vast aquatic networks using consistent and quantitative methods to build a standardized data foundation that helps MNR staff with landscape level planning and policy development.</div><div><p><br />&nbsp;</p><div><div><strong>Supporting Documentation</strong></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones%20et%20al%202025%20-%20Interpreting%20and%20using%20the%20Aquatic%20Ecosystem%20Classification%20V3%20-%20SRB%20TR70.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones et al. 2025 - Interpreting and using the Aquatic Ecosystem Classification V3 – SRB Technical Report 70 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones%20et%20al%202025%20-%20Aquatic%20Ecosystem%20Classification%20V3%20-%20SRB%20TR69.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones et al. 2025 - Aquatic Ecosystem Classification V3 – SRB Technical Report 69 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-and-Sutton-2025-Growing-season-metrics-for-Ontarios-rivers-and-streams-SRB-TR76.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones and Sutton 2025 - Growing season metrics for rivers and streams - SRB Technical Report 76 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/jones-et-al.-2024-ecological-classification-flow-regimes-ontario.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones et al. 2024 - Ecological classification flow regimes in Ontario (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/sutton-et-al.-2024-stream-temperature-modelling-and-classification-with-cc-projections.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Sutton et al. 2024 - Stream temperature modelling and classification using climate change projections - SRB Technical Report 62 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/SuttonEtAl2024ThermalHabitatOfFlowingWatersInOntario.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Sutton et al. 2024 - Thermal habitat of flowing waters in Ontario (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones%20et%20al%202021%20-%20Human%20disturbance%20gradients%20for%20Ontario%20streams.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones et al. 2021 - Human disturbance gradients for Ontario streams - SRB Technical Report 33 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-etal-2021-thermal-habitat-flowing-waters-Ontario.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones et al. 2021 - Thermal habitat flowing waters Ontario (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Schmidt-Jones-2020-Reach-Affinity-Tool-RAFT.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Schmidt and Jones 2020 - Reach Affinity Tool (RAFT) (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-Schmidt-2019-AECV1-review-direction-forward.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones and Schmidt 2019 - AECV1 review and direction forward (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-Schmidt-2019-understanding-thermal-habitat-streams.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones and Schmidt 2019 - Understanding thermal habitat in streams (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-Schmidt-2017-AECV1.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones and Schmidt 2017 - Aquatic Ecosystem Classification V1 (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Melles-etal-2014-heuristic-guide-aquatic-classification.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Melles et al. 2014 - Heuristic guide to aquatic classification (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Melles-etal-2013-AEC-Ontario-technical-proposal.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Melles et al. 2013 - AEC Ontario technical proposal (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Melles-etal-2013-review-evaluation-AEC-worldwide.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Melles et al. 2013 - Review and evaluation of AEC worldwide (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Melles-etal-2012-review-theoretical-developments-stream-ecology.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Melles et al. 2012 - Review of theoretical developments in stream ecology (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Melles-etal-2011-AEC-client-needs-survey-response.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Melles et al. 2011 - AEC client needs survey response (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-2010-CJFAS-Lake-outlets.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones 2010 - CJFAS Lake outlets (PDF)</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Jones-2010-CJFAS-Lake-outlets-erratum.pdf' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Jones 2010 - CJFAS Lake outlets erratum (PDF)</a></li></ul></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>AEC Data Packages</strong></div><div><div><ul><li>AEC Package 01 - Lake Erie (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package01_LakeErie.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase </a>| <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package01_LakeErie.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 02 - Lake Ontario (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package02_LakeOntario.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package02_LakeOntario.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 03 - Ottawa / St. Lawrence Rivers (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package03_OttawaStLawrenceRivers.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package03_OttawaStLawrenceRivers.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 04 - Lake Huron South (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package04_LakeHuronSouth.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package04_LakeHuronSouth.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 05 - Lake Huron North (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package05_LakeHuronNorth.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package05_LakeHuronNorth.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 06 - Lake Superior (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package06_LakeSuperior.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package06_LakeSuperior.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 07 - Nelson River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package07_NelsonRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package07_NelsonRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 08 - Moose River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package08_MooseRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package08_MooseRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 09 - Albany River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package09_AlbanyRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package09_AlbanyRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 10 - Hudson Bay Coastal (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package10_HudsonBayCoastal.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package10_HudsonBayCoastal.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 11 - Attawapiskat River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package11_AttawapiskatRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package11_AttawapiskatRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 12 - Winisk River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package12_WiniskRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package12_WiniskRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 13 - Severn River (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package13_SevernRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package13_SevernRiver.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li><li>AEC Package 14 - Whole Province (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GDB_Package14_WholeProvince.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Rev0_GPKG_Package14_WholeProvince.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geopackage</a>)</li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Supplementary Data (Note: These packages contain attribute-only data. They need to be joined to the spatial AEC data packages above.)</strong></div><ul><li><div>Growing season metrics for rivers and streams (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Supplemental_Stream_GrowingSeasonMetrics_FileGeodatabase.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_V3_GeoHub_Supplemental_Stream_GrowingSeasonMetrics_DelimitedText.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Delimited text</a>)</div></li><li>Climate change projections for stream temperatures (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC3_supplemental_climate_change_stream_temperature_projections_arcpro303_geodatabase.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC3_supplemental_climate_change_stream_temperature_projections_delimited_text_files.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Delimited text</a>)</li><li>Ecological classification of flow regimes (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC3_supplemental_ecological_flow_regime_classification_arcpro303_geodatabase.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC3_supplemental_ecological_flow_regime_classification_delimited_text_files.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Delimited text</a>)</li><li>Human disturbance gradients in Mixedwood Plains streams (<a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_supplementary_MWP_human_disturbance_gradients_geodatabase.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Geodatabase</a> | <a target='_blank' href='https://ws.gisetl.lrc.gov.on.ca/fmedatadownload/Packages/AEC_supplementary_MWP_human_disturbance_gradients.zip' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Delimited text</a>)</li></ul></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Status</strong></div><div>Completed: production of the data has been completed</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></div><div>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Contact</strong></div><div>Aquatic Research and Monitoring Section</div><ul><li><div><a href='mailto:AEC@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AEC@ontario.ca</a></div></li></ul></div></div></div>"
